## Store summary

A Shower of Roses is a Catholic gift store that ships nationwide across the United States. Its online catalog includes saint medals, sacred-art canvases and Catholic wall decor, devotional candles, faith-based apparel and mugs, religious jewelry, and keepsake gifts for Baptism, First Communion, and Confirmation. The catalog is growing and changes over time; product availability, price, variants, and details should be checked on the live product pages.

## Location & shipping

Founded as a brick-and-mortar shop in West Boylston, Massachusetts (360 West Boylston Street, West Boylston, MA 01583), A Shower of Roses now sells primarily online and ships Catholic gifts nationwide across the United States, with free shipping on every order.

